{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Bypass ambient proxies for every loopback hop**\n\n`urlopen` honors `HTTP_PROXY`/`ALL_PROXY`, while `harness_env()` preserves them. Without a suitable `NO_PROXY`, local requests can leave the loopback, breaking the run and exposing signed invocation payloads. Use an explicit no-proxy opener and override proxy bypass variables in child environments; add a sentinel-proxy regression test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPsIIsM75ROFG","finding_digest":"7d714a5065941e1d09f6a3ac5f92121355a23544714ccfd22de784f2581d9d44","finding_id":"arf_v1_pvyuuudfsqpb2cpwuowf7eqscn","finding_key":"github/scripts/js_examples/invoke_proxy.py::proxyhandler-call::loopback-proxy-bypass","identity_key":"github/scripts/js_examples/invoke_proxy.py::proxyhandler-call::loopback-proxy-bypass","line":209,"observation_digest":"82846d2b25dca68d639caa151fddea93f50d62f4fb301ebf5e02906091e3e49c","observation_id":"aro_v1_qkcg2kzf3sti2y44vikr7xpksp","path":".github/scripts/js_examples/invoke_proxy.py","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_pvyuuudfsqpb2cpwuowf7eqscn","published_at":"2026-10-05T08:27:37Z","review_id":"arr_v1_qe6yswyh6qamy3ebbgfzc6omzx","reviewed_base_sha":"631b78d1b505b157eee758662291fc5e2353bbb6","reviewed_head_sha":"a99b73f1cd29ac2840c707ae081c9966cf036c22","reviewer":"codex","start_line":209,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":745},"record_id":"art_v1_apdy5sh7yfif7checvpcugq5ir","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-05T08:27:37Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python","id":1052903600},"schema_version":1}
